## 🔄 System Workflow

### Automated Assignment Process:

```
1. Farmer Registers Crop
   ↓
2. System Checks Maturity (450+ days)
   ↓
3. Daily Job Creates Assignment (24h cycle)
   ↓
4. Request Sent to Farmer (12h timeout)
   ↓
5a. Farmer Accepts → Assignment Confirmed
5b. Farmer Rejects → Machine Released
5c. Timeout → Auto-reject, Machine Released
   ↓
6. Machine Status → Busy
   ↓
7. Owner Completes Work
   ↓
8. Owner Marks Machine → Idle
   ↓
9. Machine Available for Next Assignment
```

