## 🔧 Troubleshooting

### Issue 1: Backend won't start
```bash
# Check PostgreSQL
sudo systemctl status postgresql
sudo systemctl start postgresql

# Test DB connection
psql -U sugarcane_user -d sugarcane_harvest -c "SELECT 1;"

# Check port 5000
lsof -i :5000
```

### Issue 2: Frontend can't connect to backend
```bash
# Check CORS in backend
# Make sure flask-cors is installed
pip install flask-cors

# Verify backend is running
curl http://localhost:5000/api/health
```

### Issue 3: Database errors
```bash
# Recreate database
sudo -u postgres psql -c "DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS sugarcane_harvest;"
sudo -u postgres psql -c "CREATE DATABASE sugarcane_harvest;"
psql -U sugarcane_user -d sugarcane_harvest -f schema.sql
```

