## 📊 API Endpoints Reference

### Authentication:
```
POST   /api/auth/signup         - Create new user
POST   /api/auth/login          - Login
POST   /api/auth/logout         - Logout
```

### Farmer:
```
GET    /api/farmer/dashboard    - Dashboard data
POST   /api/farmer/register-crop - Register new crop
POST   /api/farmer/request/{id}/accept - Accept assignment
POST   /api/farmer/request/{id}/reject - Reject assignment
```

### Machine Owner:
```
GET    /api/machine/dashboard   - Dashboard data
POST   /api/machine/register    - Register machine
PUT    /api/machine/{id}/status - Update status (idle/busy)
```

### Factory Admin:
```
GET    /api/factory/dashboard   - Dashboard with analytics
POST   /api/factory/trigger-assignment - Manual assignment
```

### Common:
```
GET    /api/notifications       - Get user notifications
GET    /api/health              - Health check
```

